Xiaojiejie-Scraping for MoviePilot V3 (2026)
Repository: https://github.com/zhimadelvdou/MoviePilot-Plugins

Based on the architecture and Manko API contract of JAVRecognize 1.1:
Copyright and original authorship: hyuan280 and upstream contributors.
https://github.com/hyuan280/MoviePilot-Plugins/tree/main/plugins.v2/javrecognize
Upstream license: GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL-3.0).

provider.py uses the upstream Manko endpoint/response contract and a rewritten
base91 decoder derived from that implementation. The V3 integration, strict
identity validation, cache, safe metadata projection, and offline tests were
rewritten for this repository. No upstream author's attribution is removed.

MoviePilot SDK and test bootstrap are supplied separately by MoviePilot:
https://github.com/jxxghp/MoviePilot
Validation baseline: v3.1.1, 6ff7dd86a14c403b0e408f778aa3174e13e15ef1.
The SDK is not bundled into this plugin repository.

